# bin/

The project's executable launcher and development command dispatcher. Contains the unified `devbin` script—a thin dispatcher that resolves the project root, loads configuration, and routes commands to handlers, following IN-AG-THIN-COORD-001 (thin coordinator).

## Dirs

- `.devbin/` -- Vendored devbin runtime with shared libraries (helpers, config, builtins, runlog, resolve, help) and configuration.

## Files

- `devbin` -- Unified dev launcher; resolves project root, loads config.yaml, and dispatches <command> to handler scripts.
